🔄 HANDOFF POINTS (Information Transfer Between People/Systems):

  1. Driver → Dispatcher (Phone/SMS)
  2. Dispatcher → GPS/CRM System (Manual lookup)
  3. Dispatcher → Driver Status Dashboard (Manual scan)
  4. Dispatcher → SMS/Voice System (Notification)
  5. Dispatcher → Ride Assignment System (Update)

RISK: Multiple handoff points = multiple opportunities for error/delay

